  m_text: Avant was a noble fisherman off the coast off Scotland who had his ship
    accidentally cross foreign waters. Taken as a prisoner, he became a slave who
    fought in battles for entertainment for other major officials in Norway. He learned
    many skills in battle and became well respected for his swordsmanship. He was
