      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Elias Kirk is the castles Spymaster\u2013 A man who knows more than what
    it seems. Elias was a war strategist where he then transitioned into intelligence
    work after being bent over in battle. He is always around the cattle and always
    up to something. Elias carries secrets but is always hesitant to whom he shares
    secrets to. Elias may know more to the King\u2019s death than anyone and could
    be a key piece to the puzzle."
